PROPOSAL — DO NOT APPLY (audit-and-propose exercise; no substrate writes)

THE REAL FIX. The storage description is served statically from Components.js
config — runtime PATCH returns 405 (MEMORY.md / D44). So the authoritative repair
is to edit the config source and rebuild (`make reset`), not to PATCH the live Pod.

File: cogitarelink-solid/css/config/void-description.json

Two classes of stale StaticStorageDescriber blocks, all left over from the
wiki-container rename (pages -> concepts; sources merged into concepts):

  rdfs:seeAlso  -> /wiki/pages/    (404)   [lines 210-219]
  rdfs:seeAlso  -> /wiki/sources/  (404)   [lines 220-229]
  prof:hasResource -> /meta/profiles/source     (404)   [lines 280-289]
  prof:hasResource -> /meta/profiles/procedure  (404)   [lines 300-309]

The seeAlso list has NO entry for the rename target /wiki/concepts/ — add one.
The source profile has no replacement (sources are concepts) — drop it.
The procedure profile pointer is wrong: the live profile token is 'howto'
(/meta/profiles/howto = 200, /meta/profiles/procedure = 404) — correct it.

